# Keep the build context tiny — the Dockerfile only COPYs app/, tests/,
# evals/, and two scripts. Without this file the context shipped multiple
# virtualenvs and model artifacts (gigabytes) to the daemon per build.
# Secrets: never let .env into the build context (2026-08-20 sweep) — the
# Dockerfile uses explicit COPYs today so nothing bakes it in, but a future
# `COPY . .` would silently layer NOVA_API_KEY / channel tokens into the image.
.env
.env.*
searxng/settings.yml
.git
.venv
venv
finetune_env
finetune_env_py313_BROKEN
finetune
finetune_output
finetune_output_27b
hf_cache
unsloth_compiled_cache
Qwen
node_modules
frontend/node_modules
.pytest_cache
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.log
.tmp
.archive
chromadb
data
local_train_data
training_data.jsonl
training_data.bak.*
*.db
